OL,3,GNEWSASchools aim to build on esports
OL,4,Aexpertise
OL,5,
OL,6,FEsports are set to be introduced at 14
OL,7,Fprimary and secondary schools in a move
OL,8,Fchiefs said would build on an area's
OL,9,Fexpertise as home to a national gaming
OL,10,Fcampus.
OL,12,FSunderland City Council claimed
OL,13,Finvestment of up to #1m would create
OL,14,F"the country's largest school-based
OL,15,Fesports programme".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
