OL,3,GNEWSASchools aim to build on esports
OL,4,Aexpertise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the area was
OL,7,F"uniquely positioned to be a national
OL,8,Fleader in educational esports" as the
OL,9,Fheadquarters of the British Esports
OL,10,FFederation was located near the Stadium
OL,11,Fof Light, home to Sunderland's Premier
OL,12,FLeague football team.
OL,14,FIntroducing supervised gaming
OL,15,Fenvironments in schools could help
OL,16,Fyoungsters develop digital skills,
OL,17,Fteamwork and confidence, the council
OL,18,Fsaid.
